  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed vehicular access will result in vehicles reversing from or onto the A10 Great Cambridge Road (Trunk Road), to the detriment of highway safety and free flow of traffic, including pedestrians and public transport, whilst there are existing opportunities for access to the site at the rear. In these respects, the proposal would be contrary to the Council's Technical Footway Guidance 2013, Policy DMD 46 of the Development Management Document (2014), and the Core Strategy (2010) Policies CP24 and CP30, as well as the aims of the NPPF.\r\r",
    "The loss of garden area and front verge would cause harm to the character and appearance of the surrounding area by means of the loss of planting and the new area for parking vehicles contrary to Core Strategy (2010) Policy CP30 and Development Management Document (2014) Policies DMD37 and DMD46."
